  "texts": {
    "preamble": "Shri Ganesh S/O. Hiriya Poojari vs The State Of Karnataka on 13 February, 2024 Author: N.S.Sanjay Gowda Bench: N.S.Sanjay Gowda -1- Nc: 2024:Khc-D:3226 Crl.P No. 100442 of 2024 In The High Court Of Karnataka, Dharwad Bench Dated This The 13Th Day Of February, 2024 Before The Hon'Ble Mr Justice N.S.Sanjay Gowda Criminal Petition No. 100442 Of 2024 Between: Shri. Ganesh S/O. Hiriya Poojari, Age. 35 Years, Occ. Business, R/O. Alanavar Cross, Alanavar, District. Dharwad, Pin-582201. ... Petitioner (By Shri T.R. Patil, Advocate) And: The State Of Karnataka, Food Safety Officer, Hubballi-Dharwad, R/By State Public Prosecutor, High Court Building, Dharwad, Pin-580011. ... Respondent Manjanna (By Shri. P.N. Hatti, Hcgp) E Digitally signed by MANJANNA E THIS CRIMINAL PETITION IS FILED U/S 482 OF CR.P.C., Date: 2024.02.17 10:55:04 +0530 PRAYING TO QUASH THE PRIVATE COMPLAINT NO.771/2018 AND ORDER OF TAKING COGNIZANCE AND ISSUANCE OF PROCESS ORDER DATED 04.02.2019 IN CC NO.176/2019 BY THE LEARNED III ADDL.CIVIL JUDGE AND JMFC COURT, DHARWAD FOR OFFENCE PUNISHABLE FOR OFFENCE U/S 59 OF THE FOOD SAFETY AND STANDARDS ACT 2006. Shri Ganesh S/O. Hiriya Poojari vs The State Of Karnataka on 13 February, 2024 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/185716264/ 1 THIS PETITION, COMING ON FOR ADMISSION, THIS DAY, THE COURT MADE THE FOLLOWING: -2- NC: 2024:KHC-D:3226 CRL.P No. 100442 of 2024 ORDER 1. This petition is filed challenging the initiation of criminal proceedings against the petitioner, who is the owner of a hotel, in which a substandard tomato sauce is alleged to have been served to the customers. 2. The complaint indicates that, the company which was supposed to have manufactured the tomato sauce has not been arrayed as an accused. It is therefore clear that a proceeding initiated in the absence of the company would be vitiated.",
    "facts": "",
    "arguments": ""
  },
